<http://purl.org/spar/mito/Mention> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\nThe action or an act of referring to, remarking upon, or introducing the name of a person or thing in spoken or written discourse, often incidentally and as not necessarily essential to the discussion.\n"@en .
